///
/// Determines the defaults for [typography] and [materialTapTargetSize].␀À␀ªËxÀ␀«5M/// A theme for customizing the colors, thickness, and shape of [Scrollbar]s.␀À␀«JèÀ␀­%™/// Defines the appearance of ink splashes produces by [InkWell]
/// and [InkResponse].
///
/// See also:
///
///  * [InkSplash.splashFactory], which defines the default splash.
